LINES = [{'id': 'rule', 'text': "In this town, the last person to laugh at a joke has to pay for everyone's lunch."}, {'id': 'fast', 'text': 'So everybody laughs fast. My mom laughs before the joke is even over. Her record? Zero point two seconds.'}, {'id': 'otto', 'text': "But my Grandpa Otto can't hear very well. He always laughs last. He's paid for 47 lunches this year."}, {'id': 'grin', 'text': 'Then Mr. Grin opened a cafe. He tells jokes all day long, and he never, ever pays.'}, {'id': 'trick', 'text': 'His trick? He whispers the punchline, so Grandpa hears it ten seconds after everyone else.'}, {'id': 'late', 'text': "Ten seconds later, Grandpa laughed. And Mr. Grin yelled, 'Lunch for thirty people, please!'"}, {'id': 'piggy', 'text': 'Grandpa shook his piggy bank. Out came three coins and one button.'}, {'id': 'threat', 'text': "Mr. Grin leaned in close. 'No money? Then you wash my dishes. Forever.'"}, {'id': 'brave', 'text': "My knees were shaking. But I walked right up and said, 'Mr. Grin, I've got a joke for you.'"}, {'id': 'silence', 'text': 'The whole cafe went silent. Nobody tells a joke to Mr. Grin. Nobody.'}, {'id': 'joke', 'text': "Why is Mr. Grin's wallet crying? Because it's about to buy lunch for the whole town!"}, {'id': 'first', 'text': 'And for the first time ever, Grandpa Otto laughed first!'}, {'id': 'secret', 'text': 'Because last night, I whispered that joke to him five times, until he heard every word.'}, {'id': 'refuse', 'text': "Mr. Grin crossed his arms. If he never laughs, he never loses. So he just didn't."}, {'id': 'wait', 'text': 'So we waited. One hour. Two hours. Grandpa did his silly chicken dance, really slowly.'}, {'id': 'snort', 'text': "Mr. Grin's lip wiggled. Then he snorted so loud, it scared a pigeon outside."}, {'id': 'pays', 'text': 'Last laugh. Lunch for two hundred and twelve people. Mr. Grin paid with tears in his eyes.'}, {'id': 'ending', 'text': 'Grandpa still laughs last. But now the whole town waits for him. And Mr. Grin laughs before the jokes even start.'}]
